  "releaseNotes": "4.0.0 (BREAKING): removed the unused Settings.JwtKey / JwtIssuer / JwtAudience / JwtExpireDays properties. 3.0.0 (BREAKING, major release for nuget.org): PostgreSQL support added across WA.Core -- the same config XML / SQL now runs on SQL Server or PostgreSQL (Npgsql). All SI.WA.* packages moved to a new major version together; reference them with matching versions.",
